t-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/sphere-wrap-party/mcm_2446/" title="mcm_2446"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_2446-195x129.jpg" width="195" height="129" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/sphere-wrap-party/mcm_2450/" title="mcm_2450"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_2450-195x129.jpg" width="195" height="129" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/sphere-wrap-party/mcm_2461/" title="mcm_2461"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_2461-195x129.jpg" width="195" height="129" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/sphere-wrap-party/mcm_2468/" title="mcm_2468"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_2468-139x210.jpg" width="139" height="210" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/sphere-wrap-party/mcm_2472/" title="mcm_2472"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_2472-195x129.jpg" width="195" height="129" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>";}i:26;a:7:{s:5:"title";s:32:"Ryan Boren: WordPress 2.6 Beta 3";s:4:"guid";s:23:"http://boren.nu/?p=1565";s:4:"link";s:56:"http://boren.nu/archives/2008/07/08/wordpress-26-beta-3/";s:11:"description";s:673:"<p>Almost there.  We have one more week to go before the final release of 2.6.  Until then, try out <a href="http://wordpress.org/wordpress-2.6-beta3.zip">Beta 3</a>.  New since Beta 2:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="http://trac.wordpress.org/ticket/6812">Image captions</a></li>\n<li>Yet more inline documentation</li>\n<li>&#8220;Add Media&#8221; buttons for the RTE full-screen mode</li>\n<li>Theme Preview fixes</li>\n<li>Gallery sorting fixes</li>\n<li>I18N fixes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See the <a href="http://trac.wordpress.org/log/trunk?rev=8299&amp;stop_rev=8226">full list of changes since Beta 2</a>.</p>\n<p><a href="http://wordpress.org/wordpress-2.6-beta3.zip">Get Beta 3</a>.</p>";s:7:"pubdate";s:31:"Wed, 09 Jul 2008 05:57:11 +0000";s:2:"dc";a:1:{s:7:"creator";s:4:"Ryan";}s:7:"summary";s:673:"<p>Almost there.  We have one more week to go before the final release of 2.6.  Until then, try out <a href="http://wordpress.org/wordpress-2.6-beta3.zip">Beta 3</a>.  New since Beta 2:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="http://trac.wordpress.org/ticket/6812">Image captions</a></li>\n<li>Yet more inline documentation</li>\n<li>&#8220;Add Media&#8221; buttons for the RTE full-screen mode</li>\n<li>Theme Preview fixes</li>\n<li>Gallery sorting fixes</li>\n<li>I18N fixes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See the <a href="http://trac.wordpress.org/log/trunk?rev=8299&amp;stop_rev=8226">full list of changes since Beta 2</a>.</p>\n<p><a href="http://wordpress.org/wordpress-2.6-beta3.zip">Get Beta 3</a>.</p>";}i:27;a:7:{s:5:"title";s:60:"Weblog Tools Collection: WordPress Plugin Releases for 07/08";s:4:"guid";s:40:"http://weblogtoolscollection.com/?p=3720";s:4:"link";s:88:"http://weblogtoolscollection.com/archives/2008/07/08/wordpress-plugin-releases-for-0708/";s:11:"description";s:1054:"<p><strong><a href="http://agapetry.net/news/introducing-role-scoper/">Role Scoper</a></strong></p>\n<p>Role Scoper is a comprehensive drop-in replacement for capability enforcement and administration in WordPress. Assign reading, editing or administration roles to users or groups on a page-specific, category-specific or other content-specific basis.</p>\n<p><strong>wpSEO [EDIT] Link removed since it is a paid plugin.<br />\n</strong></p>\n<p>The wpSEO plugin helps you optimize your blog for SEO purposes by eliminating issues with duplicate content and specifying meta tags and page titles for the different pages of your blog. <em>Page is in German. English and German files are included in the download</em></p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://notepad.emaillink.de/2008/02/15/related-posts-by-categories-plugin-fuer-wordpress/">Related Posts by Categories für WordPress</a></strong></p>\n<p>The Plugin looks for related posts from the same categories as the current article. With numerous customization of the call to function. <em>Page in German</em></p>";s:7:"pubdate";s:31:"Tue, 08 Jul 2008 20:14:47 +0000";s:2:"dc";a:1:{s:7:"creator";s:4:"Ajay";}s:7:"summary";s:1054:"<p><strong><a href="http://agapetry.net/news/introducing-role-scoper/">Role Scoper</a></strong></p>\n<p>Role Scoper is a comprehensive drop-in replacement for capability enforcement and administration in WordPress. Assign reading, editing or administration roles to users or groups on a page-specific, category-specific or other content-specific basis.</p>\n<p><strong>wpSEO [EDIT] Link removed since it is a paid plugin.<br />\n</strong></p>\n<p>The wpSEO plugin helps you optimize your blog for SEO purposes by eliminating issues with duplicate content and specifying meta tags and page titles for the different pages of your blog. <em>Page is in German. English and German files are included in the download</em></p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://notepad.emaillink.de/2008/02/15/related-posts-by-categories-plugin-fuer-wordpress/">Related Posts by Categories für WordPress</a></strong></p>\n<p>The Plugin looks for related posts from the same categories as the current article. With numerous customization of the call to function. <em>Page in German</em></p>";}i:28;a:7:{s:5:"title";s:60:"Weblog Tools Collection: WordPress Plugin Releases for 07/07";s:4:"guid";s:40:"http://weblogtoolscollection.com/?p=3719";s:4:"link";s:88:"http://weblogtoolscollection.com/archives/2008/07/07/wordpress-plugin-releases-for-0707/";s:11:"description";s:1509:"<p><strong><a href="http://www.weedeedee.com/wordpress/google-docs-rsvp-guestlist-plugin-for-wordpress/">Google Docs RSVP Guestlist Plugin for Wordpress</a></strong></p>\n<p>This plugin allows you to add RSVP and guestlist functionality to your Wordpress site.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://bluesome.net/post/2005/08/18/50/">Exec-PHP</a></strong></p>\n<p>The Exec-PHP plugin allows  tags inside the content or excerpt of your posts and pages aswell as in text widgets to be executed just as in usual PHP files.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://www.musterion.net/tippy/">Tippy</a></strong></p>\n<p>Tippy is a friendly little WordPress plugin that gives you a way to include highly configurable tooltips in your WordPress site.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://www.musterion.net/wordpress-esv-plugin/">ESV Plugin</a></strong></p>\n<p>This plugin will retrieve Bible passages from the ESV Web Service and display them on your page as a tooltip, a block quote, a link, or just the reference.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://www.weinschenker.name/plugin-feed-reading-blogroll/">Feed reading Blogroll</a></strong></p>\n<p>This plugin provides a sidebar-widget and a template-tag that add an enhanced blogroll to your sidebar. It checks on all your linked sites for which you saved a separate feed-url, when the most recent update has occurred.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://yoast.com/wordpress/email-commenters/">Email Commenters</a></strong></p>\n<p>An easy way to e-mail all the people who commented on a certain post.</p>";s:7:"pubdate";s:31:"Mon, 07 Jul 2008 21:51:24 +0000";s:2:"dc";a:1:{s:7:"creator";s:4:"Ajay";}s:7:"summary";s:1509:"<p><strong><a href="http://www.weedeedee.com/wordpress/google-docs-rsvp-guestlist-plugin-for-wordpress/">Google Docs RSVP Guestlist Plugin for Wordpress</a></strong></p>\n<p>This plugin allows you to add RSVP and guestlist functionality to your Wordpress site.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://bluesome.net/post/2005/08/18/50/">Exec-PHP</a></strong></p>\n<p>The Exec-PHP plugin allows  tags inside the content or excerpt of your posts and pages aswell as in text widgets to be executed just as in usual PHP files.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://www.musterion.net/tippy/">Tippy</a></strong></p>\n<p>Tippy is a friendly little WordPress plugin that gives you a way to include highly configurable tooltips in your WordPress site.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://www.musterion.net/wordpress-esv-plugin/">ESV Plugin</a></strong></p>\n<p>This plugin will retrieve Bible passages from the ESV Web Service and display them on your page as a tooltip, a block quote, a link, or just the reference.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://www.weinschenker.name/plugin-feed-reading-blogroll/">Feed reading Blogroll</a></strong></p>\n<p>This plugin provides a sidebar-widget and a template-tag that add an enhanced blogroll to your sidebar. It checks on all your linked sites for which you saved a separate feed-url, when the most recent update has occurred.</p>\n<p><strong><a href="http://yoast.com/wordpress/email-commenters/">Email Commenters</a></strong></p>\n<p>An easy way to e-mail all the people who commented on a certain post.</p>";}i:29;a:7:{s:5:"title";s:38:"Weblog Tools Collection: Live Blogroll";s:4:"guid";s:40:"http://weblogtoolscollection.com/?p=3718";s:4:"link";s:67:"http://weblogtoolscollection.com/archives/2008/07/07/live-blogroll/";s:11:"description";s:670:"<p>Vladimir Prelovac has come up with yet another cool plugin, this time called <a href="http://www.prelovac.com/vladimir/wordpress-plugins/live-blogroll" target="_blank">Live Blogroll.</a> Live Blogroll replaces the default blogroll in that when a user hovers their mouse over a link, the rss feed from that site is aggregated in an Ajax created box showcasing the most recent (configured number) of posts. The Live Blogroll uses internal caching for feed discovery and WordPress caching for RSS feeds to keep everything from slowing down to a crawl.</p>\n<p>Vladimir is on a roll in terms of creating cool WordPress plugins. This one is yet another shining example.</p>";s:7:"pubdate";s:31:"Mon, 07 Jul 2008 10:00:40 +0000";s:2:"dc";a:1:{s:7:"creator";s:13:"Jeff Chandler";}s:7:"summary";s:670:"<p>Vladimir Prelovac has come up with yet another cool plugin, this time called <a href="http://www.prelovac.com/vladimir/wordpress-plugins/live-blogroll" target="_blank">Live Blogroll.</a> Live Blogroll replaces the default blogroll in that when a user hovers their mouse over a link, the rss feed from that site is aggregated in an Ajax created box showcasing the most recent (configured number) of posts. The Live Blogroll uses internal caching for feed discovery and WordPress caching for RSS feeds to keep everything from slowing down to a crawl.</p>\n<p>Vladimir is on a roll in terms of creating cool WordPress plugins. This one is yet another shining example.</p>";}i:30;a:7:{s:5:"title";s:21:"Matt: July 4th Picnic";s:4:"guid";s:20:"http://ma.tt/?p=6568";s:4:"link";s:37:"http://ma.tt/2008/07/july-4th-picnic/";s:11:"description";s:13277:"<p>At Maya&#8217;s for a July 4th picnic.</p>\n<p><span id="more-6568"></span></p>\n\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/july-4th-picnic/mcm_1966/" title="mcm_1966"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_1966-195x129.jpg" width="195" height="129" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/july-4th-picnic/mcm_1969/" title="mcm_1969"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_1969-195x129.jpg" width="195" height="129" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/july-4th-picnic/mcm_1973/" title="mcm_1973"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_1973-195x129.jpg" width="195" height="129" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/july-4th-picnic/mcm_1978/" title="mcm_1978"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_1978-139x210.jpg" width="139" height="210" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/july-4th-picnic/mcm_1980/" title="mcm_1980"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_1980-195x129.jpg" width="195" height="129" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/july-4th-picnic/mcm_1983/" title="mcm_1983"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/files/2008/07/mcm_1983-139x210.jpg" width="139" height="210" class="attachment-thumbnail" alt="" /></a>\n<a href="http://ma.tt/2008/07/july-4th-picnic/mcm_1986/" title="mcm_1986"><img src="http://s.ma.tt/